{
  "title": "Sahifa Sajjadiya 4: Blessings upon the Attesters to the Messengers",
  "data": "اللَّهُمَّ وَاَتْبَاعُ الرُّسُلِ وَمُصَدِّقُوهُمْ مِنْ اَهْلِ الْاَرْضِ بِالْغَيْبِ عِنْدَ مُعَارَضَةِ الْمُعَانِدِينَ لَهُمْ بِالتَّكْذِيبِ وَالِاشْتِيَاقِ اِلَى الْمُرْسَلِينَ بِحَقَائِقِ الْاِيمَانِ\nALLAAHUMMA WA ATBAA'UR RUSULI WA MUSADDIQOOHUM MIN AHLIL ARDI BIL GHAYBI I'NDA MU'AARADATIL MU'AANIDEENA LAHUM BIT TAKDHEEBI WAL ISHTIYAAQI ILAL MURSALEENA BIHAQAA'IQIL EEMAAN\nO God, as for the followers of the messengers and those of the people of the earth who attested to them unseen (while the obstinate resisted them through crying lies) - they yearned for the emissaries through the realities of faith,\nفِي كُلِّ دَهْرٍ وَزَمَانٍ اَرْسَلْتَ فِيهِ رَسُولًا وَاَقَمْتَ لِاَهْلِهٖ دَلِيلًا مِنْ لَدُنْ آدَمَ اِلَى مُحَمَّدٍ صَلَّى اللَّهُ عَلَيْهِ وَآلِهٖ مِنْ اَئِمَّةِ الْهُدَى، وَقَادَةِ اَهْلِ التُّقَى، عَلَى جَمِيعِهِمُ السَّلَامُ، فَاذْكُرْهُمْ مِنْكَ بِمَغْفِرَةٍ وَرِضْوَانٍ\nFEE KULLI DAHRIN WA ZAMAANIN ARSALTA FEEHI RASOOLAN WA AQAMTA LI-AHLIHEE DALEELAN MIN LADUN AADAMA ILAA MUHAMMADIN SALLALLAAHU A'LAYHI WA AALIHEE MIN A'IMMATIL HUDAA WA QAADATI AHLIT TUQAA A'LAA JAMEE'IHIMUS SALAAMU FADHKURHUM MINKA BIMAGHFIRATIN WA RIDWAAN\nin every era and time in which Thou didst send a messenger and set up for the people a director from the period of Adam down to Muhammad (God bless him and his Household) from among the imams of guidance and the leaders of the godfearing (upon them all be peace) - remember them with forgiveness and good pleasure!\nاللَّهُمَّ وَاَصْحَابُ مُحَمَّدٍ خَاصَّةً الَّذِينَ اَحْسَنُوا الصَّحَابَةَ وَالَّذِينَ اَبْلَوُا الْبَلَاءَ الْحَسَنَ فِي نَصْرِهٖ، وَاسْتَجَابُوا لَهٗ حَيْثُ اَسْمَعَهُمْ حُجَّةَ رِسَالَاتِهٖ\nALLAAHUMMA WA AS-HAABU MUHAMMADIN KHAASSATANIL LADHEENA AHSANUS SAHAABATA WAL LADHEENA ABLAWUL BALAA'AL HASANA FEE NASRIHEE WASTAJAABOO LAHOO HAYTHU ASMA'AHUM HUJJATA RISAALAATIH\nO God, and as for the Companions of Muhammad specifically, those who did well in companionship, who stood the good test in helping him, responded to him when he made them hear his messages' argument,\nوَفَارَقُوا الْاَزْوَاجَ وَالْاَوْلَادَ فِي اِظْهَارِ كَلِمَتِهٖ، وَقَاتَلُوا الْآبَاءَ وَالْاَبْنَاءَ فِي تَثْبِيتِ نُبُوَّتِهٖ، وَانْتَصَرُوا بِهٖ\nWA FAARAQUL AZWAAJA WAL AWLAADA FEE IZHAARI KALIMATIHEE WA QAATALUL AABAA'A WAL ABNAA'A FEE TATHBEETI NUBUWWATIHEE WANTASAROO BIH\nseparated from mates and children in manifesting his word, fought against fathers and sons in strengthening his prophecy, and through him gained victory;\nوَمَنْ كَانُوا مُنْطَوِينَ عَلَى مَحَبَّتِهٖ يَرْجُونَ تِجَارَةً لَنْ تَبُورَ فِي مَوَدَّتِهٖ\nWA MAN KAANOO MUNTAWEENA A'LAA MAHABBATIHEE YARJOONA TIJAARATAN LAN TABOORA FEE MAWADDATIH\nthose who were wrapped in affection for him, hoping for a commerce that comes not to naught in love for him;\nوَالَّذِينَ هَجَرَتْهُمُ الْعَشَائِرُ اِذْ تَعَلَّقُوا بِعُرْوَتِهٖ، وَانْتَفَتْ مِنْهُمُ الْقَرَابَاتُ اِذْ سَكَنُوا فِي ظِلِّ قَرَابَتِهٖ\nWAL LADHEENA HAJARAT-HUMUL A'SHAA'IRU IDH TA'ALLAQOO BI-U'RWATIHEE WANTAFAT MINHUMUL QARAABAATU IDH SAKANOO FEE ZILLI QARAABATIH\nthose who were left by their clans when they clung to his handhold and denied by their kinsfolk when they rested in the shadow of his kinship;\nفَلَا تَنْسَ لَهُمُ اللَّهُمَّ مَا تَرَكُوا لَكَ وَفِيكَ، وَاَرْضِهِمْ مِنْ رِضْوَانِكَ، وَبِمَا حَاشُوا الْخَلْقَ عَلَيْكَ، وَكَانُوا مَعَ رَسُولِكَ دُعَاةً لَكَ اِلَيْكَ\nFALAA TANSA LAHUMULLAAHUMMA MAA TARAKOO LAKA WA FEEKA WA ARDIHIM MIN RIDWAANIKA WA BIMAA HAASHUL KHALQA A'LAYKA WA KAANOO MA'A RASOOLIKA DU'AATAN LAKA ILAYK\nforget not, O God, what they abandoned for Thee and in Thee, and make them pleased with Thy good pleasure for the sake of the creatures they drove to Thee while they were with Thy Messenger, summoners to Thee for Thee.\nوَاشْكُرْهُمْ عَلَى هَجْرِهِمْ فِيكَ دِيَارَ قَوْمِهِمْ، وَخُرُوجِهِمْ مِنْ سَعَةِ الْمَعَاشِ اِلَى ضِيقِهٖ، وَمَنْ كَثَّرْتَ فِي اِعْزَازِ دِينِكَ مِنْ مَظْلُومِهِمْ\nWASHKURHUM A'LAA HAJRIHIM FEEKA DIYAARA QAWMIHIM WA KHUROOJIHIM MIN SA'ATIL MA'AASHI ILAA DEEQIHEE WA MAN KATHTHARTA FEE I'ZAAZI DEENIKA MIN MAZLOOMIHIM\nShow gratitude to them for leaving the abodes of their people for Thy sake and going out from a plentiful livelihood to a narrow one, and [show gratitude to] those of them who became objects of wrongdoing and whom Thou multiplied in exalting Thy religion.\nاللَّهُمَّ وَاَوْصِلْ اِلَى التَّابِعِينَ لَهُمْ بِاِحْسَانٍ، الَّذِينَ يَقُولُونَ رَبَّنَا اغْفِرْ لَنَا وَلِاِخْوَانِنَا الَّذِينَ سَبَقُونَا بِالْاِيمَانِ خَيْرَ جَزَائِكَ\nALLAAHUMMA WA AWSIL ILAT TAABI'EENA LAHUM BI-IHSAANINIL LADHEENA YAQOOLOONA RABBANAGH FIR LANAA WA LI-IKHWAANINAL LADHEENA SABAQOONAA BIL EEMAANI KHAYRA JAZAA'IK\nO God, and give to those who have done well in following the Companions, who say, Our Lord, forgive us and our brothers who went before us in faith, Thy best reward;\nالَّذِينَ قَصَدُوا سَمْتَهُمْ، وَتَحَرَّوْا وِجْهَتَهُمْ، وَمَضَوْا عَلَى شَاكِلَتِهِمْ\nALLADHEENA QASADOO SAMTAHUM WA TAHARRAW WIJHATAHUM WA MADAW A'LAA SHAAKILATIHIM\nthose who went straight to the Companions' road, sought out their course, and proceeded in their manner.\nلَمْ يَثْنِهِمْ رَيْبٌ فِي بَصِيرَتِهِمْ، وَلَمْ يَخْتَلِجْهُمْ شَكٌّ فِي قَفْوِ آثَارِهِمْ، وَالِائْتِمَامِ بِهِدَايَةِ مَنَارِهِمْ\nLAM YATHNIHIM RAYBUN FEE BASEERATIHIM WA LAM YAKHTALIJHUM SHAKKUN FEE QAFWI AATHAARIHIM WAL I'TIMAAMI BIHIDAAYATI MANAARIHIM\nNo doubt concerning their sure insight diverted them and no uncertainty shook them from following in their tracks and being led by the guidance of their light.\nمُكَانِفِينَ وَمُوَازِرِينَ لَهُمْ، يَدِينُونَ بِدِينِهِمْ، وَيَهْتَدُونَ بِهَدْيِهِمْ، يَتَّفِقُونَ عَلَيْهِمْ، وَلَا يَتَّهِمُونَهُمْ فِيمَا اَدَّوْا اِلَيْهِمْ\nMUKAANIFEENA WA MUWAAZIREENA LAHUM YADEENOONA BIDEENIHIM WA YAHTADOONA BIHADYIHIM YATTAFIQOONA A'LAYHIM WA LAA YATTAHIMOONAHUM FEEMAA ADDAW ILAYHIM\nAs their assistants and supporters, they professed their religion, gained guidance through their guidance, came to agreement with them, and never accused them in what they passed on to them.\nاللَّهُمَّ وَصَلِّ عَلَى التَّابِعِينَ مِنْ يَوْمِنَا هٰذَا اِلَى يَوْمِ الدِّينِ وَعَلَى اَزْوَاجِهِمْ وَعَلَى ذُرِّيَّاتِهِمْ وَعَلَى مَنْ اَطَاعَكَ مِنْهُمْ\nALLAAHUMMA WA SALLI A'LAT TAABI'EENA MIN YAWMINAA HAADHAA ILAA YAWMID DEENI WA A'LAA AZWAAJIHIM WA A'LAA DHURRIYYAATIHIM WA A'LAA MAN ATAA'AKA MINHUM\nO God, and bless the Followers, from this day of ours to the Day of Doom, their wives, their offspring, and those among them who obey Thee,\nصَلَاةً تَعْصِمُهُمْ بِهَا مِنْ مَعْصِيَتِكَ، وَتَفْسَحُ لَهُمْ فِي رِيَاضِ جَنَّتِكَ، وَتَمْنَعُهُمْ بِهَا مِنْ كَيْدِ الشَّيْطَانِ، وَتُعِينُهُمْ بِهَا عَلَى مَا اسْتَعَانُوكَ عَلَيْهِ مِنْ بِرٍّ، وَتَقِيهِمْ طَوَارِقَ اللَّيْلِ وَالنَّهَارِ اِلَّا طَارِقاً يَطْرُقُ بِخَيْرٍ\nSALAATAN TA'SIMUHUM BIHAA MIN MA'SIYATIKA WA TAFSAHU LAHUM FEE RIYAADI JANNATIKA WA TAMNA'UHUM BIHAA MIN KAYDISH SHAYTAANI WA TU'EENUHUM BIHAA A'LAA MAS TA'AANOOKA A'LAYHI MIN BIRRIN WA TAQEEHIM TAWAARIQAL LAYLI WAN NAHAARI ILLAA TAARIQAN YATRUQU BIKHAYR\nwith a blessing through which Thou wilt preserve them from disobeying Thee, make room for them in the plots of Thy Garden, defend them from the trickery of Satan, help them in the piety in which they seek help from Thee, protect them from sudden events that come by night and day - except the events which come with good -\nوَتَبْعَثُهُمْ بِهَا عَلَى اعْتِقَادِ حُسْنِ الرَّجَاءِ لَكَ، وَالطَّمَعِ فِيمَا عِنْدَكَ وَتَرْكِ التُّهَمَةِ فِيمَا تَحْوِيهِ اَيْدِي الْعِبَادِ\nWA TAB'ATHUHUM BIHAA A'LA' TIQAADI HUSNIR RAJAA'I LAKA WAT TAMA'I FEEMAA I'NDAKA WA TARKIT TUHAMATI FEEMAA TAHWEEHI AYDIL I'BAAD\nand incite them, through it (this blessing), to tie firmly the knot of good hope in Thee, desire what is with Thee, and refrain from ill thoughts [toward Thee] because of what the hands of Thy servants' hold.\nلِتَرُدَّهُمْ اِلَى الرَّغْبَةِ اِلَيْكَ وَالرَّهْبَةِ مِنْكَ، وَتُزَهِّدَهُمْ فِي سَعَةِ الْعَاجِلِ، وَتُحَبِّبَ اِلَيْهِمُ الْعَمَلَ لِلْآجِلِ، وَالِاسْتِعْدَادَ لِمَا بَعْدَ الْمَوْتِ\nLITARUDDAHUM ILAR RAGHBATI ILAYKA WAR RAHBATI MINKA WA TUZAHHIDAHUM FEE SA'ATIL A'AJILI WA TUHABBIBA ILAYHIMUL A'MALA LIL AAJILI WAL ISTI'DAADA LIMAA BA'DAL MAWT\nThus Thou mayest restore them to beseeching Thee and fearing Thee, induce them to renounce the plenty of the immediate, make them love to work for the sake of the deferred and prepare for what comes after death,\nوَتُهَوِّنَ عَلَيْهِمْ كُلَّ كَرْبٍ يَحِلُّ بِهِمْ يَوْمَ خُرُوجِ الْاَنْفُسِ مِنْ اَبْدَانِهَا\nWA TUHAWWINA A'LAYHIM KULLA KARBIN YAHILLU BIHIM YAWMA KHUROOJIL ANFUSI MIN ABDAANIHAA\nmake easy for them every distress that comes to them on the day when souls take leave from bodies,\nوَتُعَافِيَهُمْ مِمَّا تَقَعُ بِهِ الْفِتْنَةُ مِنْ مَحْذُورَاتِهَا، وَكَبَّةِ النَّارِ وَطُولِ الْخُلُودِ فِيهَا\nWA TU'AAFIYAHUM MIMMAA TAQA'U BIHIL FITNATU MIN MAHDHOORAATIHAA WA KABBATIN NAARI WA TOOLIL KHULOODI FEEHAA\nrelease them from that which brings about the perils of temptation and being thrown down in the Fire and staying forever within it,\nوَتُصَيِّرَهُمْ اِلَى اَمْنٍ مِنْ مَقِيلِ الْمُتَّقِينَ\nWA TUSAYYIRAHUM ILAA AMNIN MIN MAQEELIL MUTTAQEEN\nand take them to security, the resting place of the godfearing.",
  "merits": "The fourth supplication of al-Sahifah al-Kamilah al-Sajjadiyyah: Imam Zayn al-Abidin (a.s.)'s supplication calling down blessings upon the followers of the messengers and those who attested to them.\n\nEnglish translation by William C. Chittick."
}
